  "name": "Model Parameter Estimator",
  "description": "The model parameter estimator function block uses a recursive least-squares algorithm to identify a mathematical model of a process. This function block calculates the parameters for a linear, first-order dynamic model with deadtime of the specific form. where: = Value of the process variable at time t. = Value of the process variable at one sample time before time t. = Value of the control output one process deadtime (expressed as k sample time increments) before t. = Model parameters.",
  "description_lines": [
