    "of a process. This function block calculates the parameters for",
    "a linear, first-order dynamic model with deadtime of the spe-",
    "cific form.",
    "where:",
    "= Value of the process variable at time t.",
    "= Value of the process variable at one sample time",
    "before time t.",
    "= Value of the control output one process deadtime",
    "(expressed as k sample time increments) before t.",
    "= Model parameters."
